   "visibility": "public",
   "docs": "Derive macros for CVLR: [`macro@Nondet`] makes a struct or enum\nnondeterministic and [`macro@CvlrLog`] makes it loggable. Use them through\n`cvlr::derive` or the `cvlr` prelude; the generated code refers to the\n`cvlr` crate.",
   "links": {
